[chara_hide_all]
[bg storage="black.webp" time="1000"]
[playbgm storage="bgm_devil.mp3"]

── That day, after the sun went down ──[l][er]

The devil visited seven girls, one by one.[l][er]

On the road outside a house. In a classroom at dusk. In a dojo at night. At a kitchen table.[l][er]
—In places where no one was watching.[l][er]

; ================================================================================
*start_scene_1
; Scene 1: 幼なじみ「家具を辞める」
; ================================================================================

[chara_hide_all]
[bg storage="street_evening.webp" time="1000"]
[playbgm storage="bgm_sadness.mp3"]

As the sun set, Yui stood in front of her house.[l][er]
Trying not to look at the window of "his" house, three doors down.[l][er]

[chara_show name="osananajimi" face="default" pos="center" time="1000"]

She opened her phone. Her chat with him.[l][er]
The last "good night" sticker was from three weeks ago.[l][er]

#osananajimi
...[l][er]

She almost sent something. Then stopped.[l][er]

"It's nothing, but—" If it's nothing, there's no reason to send it.[l][er]
"It's not nothing, but—" Things that aren't nothing can't be sent.[l][er]

#osananajimi
..."Childhood friend" is such a convenient thing, isn't it.[l][er]

#osananajimi
Not a girlfriend. Not a stranger.[l][er]

#osananajimi
An insurance policy that says "we can see each other anytime."[l][er]

[chara_show name="akuma" face="default" pos="left" time="1000"]

#akuma
Do you want to stay inside that insurance forever?[l][er]

#osananajimi
—! Who's there?[l][er]

[chara_show name="osananajimi" face="surprised" pos="center" time="500"]

#akuma
It's not that he doesn't choose you even though you've always been beside him.[l][er]

#akuma
He doesn't choose you BECAUSE you've always been beside him.[l][er]

#osananajimi
...[l][er]

—She knew.[l][er]

To him, "childhood friend" was furniture.[l][er]
Nobody chooses furniture.[l][er]
It's just there, from the very start.[l][er]

The devil held out a bottle.[l][er]

#akuma
Drink this, and you can quit being furniture.[l][er]

#osananajimi
...What does that mean?[l][er]

#akuma
You won't be "the Yui he's used to" anymore.[l][er]

[chara_show name="osananajimi" face="sad" pos="center" time="500"]

#osananajimi
...Can I go back?[l][er]

#akuma
No.[l][er]

#osananajimi
...[l][er]

When it said "no going back,"[l][er]
instead of being afraid,[l][er]
she caught herself thinking, "Good."[l][er]

She took the bottle.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="akuma" time="1000"]
[chara_hide name="osananajimi" time="1000"]


; ================================================================================
*start_scene_2
; Scene 2: 生徒会長「完璧の上に積む」
; ================================================================================

[chara_hide_all]
[bg storage="student_council_room.webp" time="1000"]
[playbgm storage="bgm_tension.mp3"]

The student council room at night.[l][er]

Stacks of paperwork. The hum of fluorescent lights.[l][er]

[chara_show name="seitokai" face="default" pos="center" time="1000"]

Rin set down her pen.[l][er]
—For the first time, in a room where no one was watching, she decided for herself when to put it down.[l][er]

#seitokai
...[l][er]

She took a deep breath and held it.[l][er]
She held it because it felt like something would crumble if she let it out.[l][er]

#seitokai
(...I was thinking about him again.)[l][er]

[chara_show name="akuma" face="default" pos="left" time="1000"]

#akuma
Being perfect looks exhausting.[l][er]

#seitokai
—! Since when have you—[l][er]

[chara_show name="seitokai" face="surprised" pos="center" time="500"]

#akuma
If you quit being "perfect," what would be left?[l][er]

#seitokai
...I am under no obligation to answer.[l][er]

#akuma
Not answering means—there IS no answer?[l][er]

#seitokai
...[l][er]

—It hit the mark.[l][er]

She didn't know who she was once she took off "the perfect student council president."[l][er]
So she couldn't take it off.[l][er]

The devil set a bottle on the desk.[l][er]

#akuma
You can stack one more thing on top of "the perfect president."[l][er]

#seitokai
...Stack what?[l][er]

#akuma
"The perfect president who is also his type."[l][er]

[chara_show name="seitokai" face="default" pos="center" time="500"]

#seitokai
...Side effects?[l][er]

#akuma
None. You just can't go back.[l][er]

#seitokai
...I don't believe going back is necessary.[l][er]

#seitokai
Given that "the original me" doesn't score high enough.[l][er]

—After she said it,[l][er]
she realized how awful her own words were.[l][er]
But she didn't take them back.[l][er]

She took the bottle.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="akuma" time="1000"]
[chara_hide name="seitokai" time="1000"]


