*start_scene_3
; Scene 3: ギャル「可愛いのレースから降りる」
; ================================================================================

[chara_hide_all]
[bg storage="classroom.webp" time="1000"]
[playbgm storage="bgm_daily.mp3"]

An empty classroom after school. Misaki sat on a desk, staring at her phone.[l][er]

[chara_show name="gyaru" face="default" pos="center" time="1000"]

Today's post: 83 likes.[l][er]
Yesterday's post: 78 likes.[l][er]
—Same as always.[l][er]

#gyaru
...Ugh.[l][er]

"Buried" was exactly the word for it.[l][er]

Being buried means[l][er]
nobody finds you.[l][er]

—Not even him.[l][er]

#gyaru
...He doesn't even follow me.[l][er]

[chara_show name="akuma" face="default" pos="left" time="1000"]

#akuma
You want to go viral, don't you?[l][er]

#gyaru
Whoa, what the hell are you—[l][er]

[chara_show name="gyaru" face="surprised" pos="center" time="500"]

#akuma
There are way too many "cute" girls already.[l][er]

#gyaru
...![l][er]

#akuma
If you sit next to "cute," you'll probably always be second place.[l][er]

—That stung.[l][er]
It was exactly what she'd been thinking more than anything.[l][er]

#akuma
Let's drop out of the "cute" race.[l][er]

#akuma
Let's run where nobody else is running.[l][er]

The devil tossed her a bottle.[l][er]

#gyaru
...What is this?[l][er]

#akuma
A body that's yours and nobody else's.[l][er]

#akuma
Not next to "cute"—number one in a whole different category.[l][er]

[chara_show name="gyaru" face="smile" pos="center" time="500"]

#gyaru
...For real?[l][er]

#akuma
For real.[l][er]

She gripped the bottle with both hands.[l][er]

—The way she held it[l][er]
wasn't "I want this."[l][er]
It was "I'm not giving this up."[l][er]

[chara_hide name="akuma" time="1000"]
[chara_hide name="gyaru" time="1000"]


