*start_scene_4
; Scene 4: オタク「最初の被験者」
; ================================================================================

[chara_hide_all]
[bg storage="science_room.webp" time="1000"]
[playbgm storage="bgm_tension.mp3"]

Night. The science room.[l][er]
Rika sat facing her computer screen.[l][er]

[chara_show name="otaku" face="default" pos="center" time="1000"]

—She was on her fifth paper on muscle enhancement.[l][er]

#otaku
...The test subjects were...[l][er]

#otaku
...all male.[l][er]

Which meant there was no precedent in a female body.[l][er]
"Uncharted territory"—a drug, for a researcher.[l][er]

#otaku
...[l][er]

Why was she researching this?[l][er]
—Because when she sat at the library computer right after him, his search history was still there.[l][er]
She'd read it three times before closing it.[l][er]

[chara_show name="akuma" face="default" pos="left" time="1000"]

#akuma
"No precedent" is fun, isn't it?[l][er]

#otaku
—! Who's there?[l][er]

[chara_show name="otaku" face="surprised" pos="center" time="500"]

#akuma
If there's no precedent, you get to write the first paper.[l][er]

#otaku
...[l][er]

#akuma
If there aren't any test subjects—[l][er]

#akuma
why not become one?[l][er]

The devil set a bottle on the desk.[l][er]

#otaku
...What's in it?[l][er]

#akuma
If you want to analyze it before drinking it, that's fine.[l][er]

#akuma
But while you're analyzing, the other six will drink first.[l][er]

[chara_show name="otaku" face="default" pos="center" time="500"]

#otaku
...The other six.[l][er]

#akuma
Yep. Same potion. I'm handing out seven.[l][er]

#otaku
...[l][er]

—She couldn't give up being "first."[l][er]

More than "his type,"[l][er]
it was the seat of "first test subject" she couldn't bear to lose.[l][er]

#otaku
...Thank you for the drink.[l][er]

#akuma
That was fast.[l][er]

#otaku
I'll do the analysis inside my own body.[l][er]

She took the bottle without hesitating.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="akuma" time="1000"]
[chara_hide name="otaku" time="1000"]


