*start_scene_5
; Scene 5: 格闘技部「努力を飛ばす」
; ================================================================================

[chara_hide_all]
[bg storage="dojo_night.webp" time="1000"]
[playbgm storage="bgm_fight.mp3"]

The dojo at night.[l][er]
Hibiki stood in front of the sandbag.[l][er]

[chara_show name="kakutogi" face="angry" pos="center" time="1000"]

—One punch.[l][er]
The sound was light.[l][er]

#kakutogi
...[l][er]

In today's practice match, she lost two rounds out of three.[l][er]

It wasn't the first time she'd lost.[l][er]
It wasn't the first time losing had hurt.[l][er]

—But[l][er]
it was the first time she'd lost in front of HIM.[l][er]

#kakutogi
(He saw...)[l][er]

#kakutogi
(He saw me weak...)[l][er]

[chara_show name="akuma" face="default" pos="left" time="1000"]

#akuma
Want to show him "the strong you"?[l][er]

#kakutogi
—Who's there?[l][er]

[chara_show name="kakutogi" face="default" pos="center" time="500"]

#akuma
Getting strong through hard work takes time.[l][er]

#akuma
Will you make it before he graduates?[l][er]

#kakutogi
...[l][er]

—She knew right away. She wouldn't.[l][er]
The days left until graduation were fewer than the room she had left to grow.[l][er]

The devil held out a bottle.[l][er]

#akuma
This is cheating.[l][er]

#kakutogi
...Cheating.[l][er]

#akuma
Yep. You get to skip the hard work.[l][er]

#akuma
You won't be "strong because you worked for it" anymore. Instead, you'll be "strong right now."[l][er]

[chara_show name="kakutogi" face="surprised" pos="center" time="500"]

#kakutogi
...That's...[l][er]

#kakutogi
That's the thing I've always rejected.[l][er]

#akuma
I know. That's why I'm asking.[l][er]

#akuma
Being seen right now, or the you that works for it—which one?[l][er]

#kakutogi
...[l][er]

She hesitated for a long time.[l][er]
The fact that she hesitated was her answer.[l][er]

She took the bottle.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="akuma" time="1000"]
[chara_hide name="kakutogi" time="1000"]


