*start_scene_6
; Scene 6: 不良「近づかれないを極める」
; ================================================================================

[chara_hide_all]
[bg storage="park_night.webp" time="1000"]
[playbgm storage="bgm_isolation.mp3"]

A park at night.[l][er]
Sae sat alone on a bench.[l][er]

[chara_show name="furyo" face="default" pos="center" time="1000"]

—She always sat alone.[l][er]

"The delinquent from the other school." "Get close and she'll hit you."[l][er]
She couldn't remember anymore who started it, or whether she'd ever really hit anyone.[l][er]

#furyo
...[l][er]

She was thinking about a boy from another school she saw on the train.[l][er]

Their eyes had met. Just once.[l][er]
—He didn't look away.[l][er]
Everyone else always looked away.[l][er]

[chara_show name="akuma" face="default" pos="left" time="1000"]

#akuma
"He didn't look away," did he?[l][er]

#furyo
—![l][er]

[chara_show name="furyo" face="angry" pos="center" time="500"]

#furyo
Who's there?[l][er]

#akuma
You can't stop thinking about the guy who didn't look away, huh.[l][er]

#furyo
...Shut up.[l][er]

#akuma
That rumor about "hitting anyone who gets close"—you didn't start it, did you?[l][er]

#furyo
...[l][er]

#akuma
You didn't start it. But you didn't correct it either.[l][er]

#akuma
Because it's easier when nobody comes near.[l][er]

—Bullseye.[l][er]

In exchange for never getting hurt,[l][er]
there was no one who came close, either.[l][er]

The devil held out a bottle.[l][er]

#akuma
Drink this, and people will keep their distance even more.[l][er]

#furyo
...And how is that supposed to be good?[l][er]

#akuma
If you take "unapproachable" all the way—[l][er]

#akuma
—you'll find out who comes close to you anyway.[l][er]

[chara_show name="furyo" face="surprised" pos="center" time="500"]

#furyo
...[l][er]

She had a feeling he would come close.[l][er]

Past the far side of "unapproachable,"[l][er]
for the first time, she wanted to be properly chosen.[l][er]

#furyo
...Give it to me.[l][er]

She took the bottle.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="akuma" time="1000"]
[chara_hide name="furyo" time="1000"]


