*start_scene_7
; Scene 7: 友達の妹「妹を置いていく」
; ================================================================================

[chara_hide_all]
[bg storage="friend_house.webp" time="1000"]
[playbgm storage="bgm_sadness.mp3"]

Night. The Takahashi family kitchen. Her brother was already asleep upstairs.[l][er]

[chara_show name="imouto" face="default" pos="center" time="1000"]

On the table, a single photo, taken out of an album.[l][er]
—Elementary school graduation.[l][er]
Her brother, her brother's best friend, and between them, her.[l][er]

#imouto
...[l][er]

The girl in the photo was smiling.[l][er]
With a "little sister" face.[l][er]

#imouto
...I'm still "the little sister," huh.[l][er]

—Ever since back then,[l][er]
she had never once been seen as anything but "the little sister."[l][er]

[chara_show name="akuma" face="default" pos="left" time="1000"]

#akuma
You can't overwrite "little sister," you know.[l][er]

#imouto
—! Who's there?[l][er]

[chara_show name="imouto" face="surprised" pos="center" time="500"]

#akuma
A girl you've known since she was little stays "the little kid" forever.[l][er]

#akuma
Even if she gets taller.[l][er]

#akuma
Even if she grows her hair out.[l][er]

#imouto
...[l][er]

—She knew.[l][er]
That's why, even when she grew her hair out,[l][er]
he never said a thing.[l][er]

The devil held out a bottle.[l][er]

#akuma
This isn't "overwriting."[l][er]

#akuma
You'd become someone else.[l][er]

[chara_show name="imouto" face="sad" pos="center" time="500"]

#imouto
...Someone else.[l][er]

#akuma
You could meet him from the very beginning as "someone who isn't a little sister."[l][er]

#imouto
...[l][er]

#imouto
Will my brother be sad?[l][er]

#akuma
Yeah. Probably.[l][er]

#imouto
...[l][er]

—Even so,[l][er]
she wanted to leave "the little sister" behind.[l][er]

She took the bottle.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="akuma" time="1000"]
[chara_hide name="imouto" time="1000"]


