; ================================================================================

[chara_hide_all]
[bg storage="black.webp" time="1000"]
[playbgm storage="bgm_devil.mp3"]

[chara_show name="akuma" face="smile" pos="center" time="1000"]

#akuma
...All delivered.[l][er]

#akuma
All seven took one.[l][er]

#akuma
—They'll probably all drink it.[l][er]

#akuma
The reason I said "whether you drink it is up to you"...[l][er]

#akuma
...was to leave just a little bit of "maybe I won't" in their eyes.[l][er]

#akuma
That look is hope.[l][er]

#akuma
And then—the moment they drink it and learn there's no going back...[l][er]

#akuma
...that look becomes fear.[l][er]

#akuma
—Delicious.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="akuma" time="1000"]

