*start_scene_9
; Scene 9: ゲームの条件
; ================================================================================

[chara_hide_all]
[bg storage="protagonist_room_night.webp" time="1000"]

Late at night. My room.[l][er]

I was lying awake staring at the ceiling when—the air in the room dropped a few degrees.[l][er]

[chara_show name="akuma" face="default" pos="center" time="1000"]

#akuma
Deliveries are done.[l][er]

#protagonist
...Don't show up in people's rooms.[l][er]

#akuma
It's after-sales service for my contractor. That's important, right?[l][er]

#akuma
Also—there's one thing I forgot to mention.[l][er]

#protagonist
...There's more?[l][er]

#akuma
How I collect my payment.[l][er]

The devil raised one finger.[l][er]

#akuma
This is a game.[l][er]

#protagonist
...A game?[l][er]

#akuma
If you and one of the seven become "the real thing"—you win.[l][er]

#akuma
In that case, I take one bite of the two of you. Wedding-gift pricing. And that's that.[l][er]

#protagonist
What do you mean, "the real thing"?[l][er]

#akuma
Seeing the masks, the bravado, the muscles, all of it—and still choosing to stay beside her.[l][er]

#akuma
It's a flavor I can't make myself. That's why it's expensive.[l][er]

#protagonist
...And if I can't?[l][er]

[chara_show name="akuma" face="smile" pos="center" time="500"]

#akuma
Good question.[l][er]

#akuma
That potion has a "second bottle."[l][er]

#protagonist
...A second bottle.[l][er]

#akuma
The first bottle changes the body.[l][er]

#akuma
The second one—remakes the heart along with it.[l][er]

#akuma
No hesitation. No wavering. No getting hurt. Very convenient.[l][er]

#protagonist
...How is that a medicine?[l][er]

#akuma
See? You already understand.[l][er]

#akuma
If any of the seven throws herself away and reaches for the second bottle—I win.[l][er]

#akuma
In that case, I take all of your emotions at once.[l][er]

#protagonist
...Why am I the one who pays?[l][er]

#akuma
Because it all started with "that one line" of yours.[l][er]

—I had nothing to say back.[l][er]

#akuma
Don't worry. The rules are simple.[l][er]

#akuma
Don't break anyone. Face one person, properly. That's all.[l][er]

The devil smiled.[l][er]

#akuma
—Though you're about to learn that's the hardest thing there is.[l][er]

[chara_hide name="akuma" time="1000"]

My palms were sweating.[l][er]

—The game had already begun.[l][er]

── And then, the night ends ──[l][er]

